1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,400
 The alarm goes off at 4.45 and the house is still dark.

2
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:08,980
 You could roll over and nobody would know.

3
00:00:08,980 --> 00:00:16,320
 You lace up anyway because over in T-neck the lights are on and your crew is waiting on you.

4
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:20,880
 Cold air, heavy legs, round one.

5
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:24,720
 By the time this town wakes up, you've already won Monday.

